# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a temporary
#  directory before pyinstaller injects the bootloader and/or makes changes
#  to the executable itself.  The python library in the collected files
#  and the copied library in the bundled application are *.so files.
*.manifest
*.spec

